# dokploy_certificates (Data Source)

Fetches all SSL certificates from Dokploy. Use this data source to discover certificate IDs for importing existing resources.

## Example Usage

```hcl
data "dokploy_certificates" "all" {}

# Output all certificate IDs for import discovery
output "certificate_ids" {
  value = { for c in data.dokploy_certificates.all.certificates : c.name => c.id }
}
```

